---
import network from '../data/rewards/network.json';
import sources from '../data/rewards/sources.json';
import logos from '../data/rewards/logos.json';
import overview from '../assets/rewards/overview.png';
const images = import.meta.glob<{ default: { src: string } }>('../assets/rewards/*', { eager: true });
const data = { ...network, sources, nodes: network.nodes.map(n => ({ ...n, logo: images['../assets/rewards/' + logos[n.id as keyof typeof logos]]?.default.src })) };
// Escape script termination, even if a source title later contains HTML.
const serialized = JSON.stringify(data).replace(/</g, '\\u003c');
---
<div class="rewards-map">

<header><div class="eyebrow">Loyalty systems / a field guide</div><div class="headrow"><div><h1>The <em>rewards</em> network.</h1><div class="desc">Where card currencies go, where everyday purchases earn, and which partnerships actually connect.<br>Click a node to isolate its neighborhood. Click a line for direction, ratios, restrictions, and sources.</div></div><div class="stat" id="stats"></div></div></header><section id="static-map"><p>Static overview. Open this page in Safari or Chrome for the interactive graph, search, and connection details.</p><img alt="Overview of card, airline, hotel and everyday rewards relationships" src={overview.src}></section>
<div class="toolbar"><button data-view="overview" class="active">Ecosystem</button><button data-view="transfer">Points transfers</button><button data-view="everyday">Everyday partners</button><button data-view="cards">Co-branded cards</button><button data-view="all">Everything</button><select id="focus"><option value="">Focus a card or program…</option></select><input id="search" placeholder="Search United, Hyatt, Uber…" aria-label="Search programs"><button id="reset">Clear focus</button><span id="counts"></span></div>
<div class="legend" id="legend"></div>
<div class="layout"><div class="canvas"><div class="zoom"><button id="zin" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button><button id="zout" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button id="fit">Fit</button><button id="export">Save SVG</button></div><svg id="graph" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Interactive rewards relationship network"></svg><div class="hint">Tap a node · drag anywhere to pan · pinch or + / − to zoom</div></div><aside><div id="details"></div></aside></div>
<section class="section"><h2>Read the edges, not just the logos.</h2><div class="callouts"><div class="callout"><b>One ride, one loyalty earning partner.</b><p>Uber’s Delta and Marriott options are alternatives. Lyft’s United, Hilton, Atmos, and Bilt links are alternatives too. Eligible payment-card earning may stack separately; the airline partners do not all stack.</p></div><div class="callout"><b>A booking partner is not a transfer partner.</b><p>You can sometimes book another airline using a program’s miles. That does not let you move miles between those airlines. Alliance and award-booking relationships are deliberately outside this map.</p></div><div class="callout"><b>Marriott is a bridge, not a free shortcut.</b><p>Bonvoy points connect to many airline programs, usually at a 3:1 base ratio. That broad reach does not make routing bank points through Marriott a good deal. Compare the final currency and award price.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><details><summary>Methodology, limitations, and source directory</summary><p class="muted">Curated U.S. consumer ecosystem, curated snapshot October 21, 2026; integration preserves that snapshot rather than claiming a new source review. Not a comprehensive global directory. Base transfer ratios exclude temporary promotions; card eligibility, minimums, fees, caps, enrollment and account-linking rules still apply. A direction arrow means the depicted direction only; two arrows mean the specific linked programs support both directions, not that conversion is lossless. Citi ratios are explicitly card-dependent. Wells Fargo’s consolidated list and Citi’s full list are cross-checked with named secondary sources, flagged below. Directories can change without notice. Logos are embedded from an existing flight app's assets; no endorsement implied. No account information or personal points balances are included. The map makes no external requests; the surrounding site uses its existing analytics.</p><p class="note">Time-sensitive: the enhanced American–Hyatt relationship is winding down; the old broad earn/status relationship is not shown as an enduring points bridge. Bilt → Hyatt is 1:1 on this snapshot date, with a reported change to 4:3 on January 1, 2027—verify the current app terms before transferring.</p><div class="sourcegrid" id="sources"></div></details></section><footer class="section footer">REWARDS NETWORK / Original snapshot 2026-10-21 / Arrows are relationships, not investment advice. Confirm award space before moving points. Bank transfers are generally irreversible.</footer>
<script id="data" type="application/json" set:html={serialized} />
</div>
<style is:global>
@scope (.rewards-map) {

:scope{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0b1118;--panel:#111b26;--muted:#90a3b8;--line:#263749;--ink:#f0f5fa;--mint:#5ee6b5;--blue:#7cb9ff;--gold:#e9c77e;--pink:#eb9cca;--violet:#b7a0f6}*{box-sizing:border-box}:scope{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}header{padding:32px 34px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 0,#16322e55,transparent 55%)}.eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2.6px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--mint)}h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:46px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-1.5px;margin:9px 0}h1 em{color:var(--mint);font-weight:400}.desc{color:#aebdcb;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;max-width:820px}.headrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px}.stat{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}.stat strong{font-size:23px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)}.toolbar{padding:16px 30px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}button,select,input{font:inherit;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #34465a;background:#15212e;border-radius:7px;padding:10px 13px}button{cursor:pointer}button:hover{border-color:var(--mint)}button.active{background:#21463d;border-color:#51bd9c;color:#c6ffe9}input{width:230px}select{max-width:240px}.legend{display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px 32px;font-size:10px;color:#aebdcb}.legend label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer}.legend input{width:12px;margin:0;accent-color:#5ee6b5}.swatch{width:23px;height:0;border-top:2px solid}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 340px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.canvas{position:relative;min-width:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 45%,#10243266,transparent 65%)}#graph{width:100%;height:min(74vw,900px);min-height:580px;display:block;touch-action:none}.hint{position:absolute;bottom:14px;left:25px;color:#7d93a7;font-size:10px;background:#0b1118d9;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #253645;border-radius:5px}.zoom{position:absolute;top:14px;left:20px;display:flex;gap:6px}.zoom button{padding:6px 11px}aside{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding:25px 23px;max-height:1000px;overflow:auto;background:#101923}aside h2{font-size:21px;font-weight:500;margin:10px 0 5px}.micro{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:var(--mint)}.muted{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#9aafc2}.insight{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px}.insight h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 7px}.note{padding:12px;border:1px solid #57482a;background:#2f291d88;border-radius:7px;color:#dccba6;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6}.relation{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:11px;border:1px solid #2b3f50;border-radius:7px;background:#13212d}.relation b{font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.relation small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#9ab1c4;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.5}.relation .tag{display:inline-block;color:#5ee6b5;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:6px}a{color:#95caff;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-word}#details p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#aabbcc}.sources a{display:block;margin:8px 0;font-size:11px}.section{padding:26px 34px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.section h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:27px;margin:0 0 15px}.callouts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}.callout{border:1px solid #293b4b;border-radius:9px;padding:18px;background:#101b25}.callout b{font-size:13px}.callout p{font-size:12px;color:#9aafc2;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:0}.footer{font-size:10px;color:#7e93a6;line-height:1.8}.sourcegrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px 25px;font-size:11px}.sourcegrid span{font-size:9px;color:#a28e6c}.edge{fill:none;pointer-events:stroke;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .16s;stroke-linecap:round}.edge:hover{stroke-width:5!important;opacity:1!important}.node{cursor:pointer;outline:none}.node rect{transition:stroke .15s,opacity .15s}.node:hover rect,.node:focus rect{stroke:#e0fff3!important;stroke-width:2}.nlabel{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;fill:#eef4fa;pointer-events:none}.nsub{font-size:10.8px;fill:#93a9bb;pointer-events:none}.colhead{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.5px;fill:#6e8a9e}.edgelabel{font-size:11px;fill:#f5f7f9;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#101923;stroke-width:5px;pointer-events:none}.empty{padding:30px;color:#aabbcc}details summary{cursor:pointer;color:#9eb8cc;font-size:12px}#counts{margin-left:auto;color:#91a5b8;font-size:11px}
@media(max-width:900px){header{padding:24px 20px}.headrow{display:block}h1{font-size:36px}.stat{text-align:left;margin-top:12px}.stat br{display:none}.stat strong{font-size:16px}.layout{display:block}aside{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);max-height:none}.toolbar,.legend{padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}.callouts,.sourcegrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section{padding:24px 20px}#graph{height:690px;min-height:0}.hint{max-width:70%;line-height:1.5}.toolbar button{padding:9px 10px}input{width:100%}.stat span{margin-right:15px}}
